  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSB framework agreement 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MSB ramavtal 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSB (Swedish Civil Contingencies Agency) Humanitarian Frame for all   humanitarian contributions financed by Sida&apos;s Humanitarian Unit. The  contributions consist of secondments, base camps, medical teams etc   in support of UN Organizations. Own contributions are capacity        development projects in connection with the establishment of rescue   services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MSB genomf&#xf6;r en m&#xe4;ngd insater i samband med humanit&#xe4;ra katastrofer,   DRR och tidig &#xe5;teruppbyggnad. Insatserna inkluderar expertst&#xf6;d inom   humanit&#xe4;r minhantering, transport och logistik, WASH, information och koordinering, boende och kontorsst&#xf6;d, samt st&#xe4;rkande av               katastrofberedskap.</narrative>
  </description>
